This file records attribution for third-party work it builds on.

Scope note: this package **redistributes none of the components below**. Python
dependencies are declared in pyproject.toml and fetched by pip from their own
publishers; the DINOv2 weights are downloaded from Hugging Face onto the user's machine
at first run. Apache 2.0 section 4 attaches its notice-retention obligations to
redistribution of a Work or Derivative Work, so those obligations are not triggered
here. The attribution is recorded anyway, because a team evaluating this software needs
to see the license surface without reading the dependency tree.

Every license below was read from the installed distribution's own metadata, or from the
upstream repository, at the versions noted. Verify again before relying on it for a
distribution of your own.


DINOv2
------
Vision transformer whose frozen weights produce every embedding this tool writes.

  Upstream:  https://github.com/facebookresearch/dinov2
  Copyright: Meta Platforms, Inc. and affiliates
  License:   Apache License 2.0
  Weights:   https://huggingface.co/facebook/dinov2-base (and -small/-large/-giant),
             licensed apache-2.0 per their model cards

  - No DINOv2 source code is copied into this repository. The model is loaded through
    Hugging Face `transformers` (`Dinov2Model.from_pretrained`), and the weights are
    fetched at runtime.
  - **DINOv2 is used unmodified.** No fine-tuning, no architectural change, no weight
    surgery — the model is a frozen feature extractor, with `requires_grad_(False)` on
    every parameter. Nothing in this package constitutes a Derivative Work of DINOv2.
  - The upstream repository ships no NOTICE file, so there is no NOTICE content to
    propagate. Its LICENSE is the unmodified Apache 2.0 text, identical to this
    package's own LICENSE.


